  "job_B7.1_20251003_114803": {
    "text": "Mann sceal \u00feurh his modes snoternysse hine sylfne geglengen to wisre lare.\nNe beo \u00feu to sl\u00e6por ne to idelgeorn, for\u00f0am \u00fee se sl\u00e6p & \u00fe\u00e6t idel fet un\u00f0eawas & unh\u00e6lo \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00d0\u00e6t we cwe\u00f0a\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t seo betst \u00e6fter gode \u00fe\u00e6t mon sie gesceadwis & gemetgian cunne \u00e6g\u00f0er ge his\n\u00d0onne \u00f0u o\u00feerne mon t\u00e6le, \u00f0onne ge\u00f0enc \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6t nan mon ne bi\u00f0 leahterleas.\n\u00d0eah \u00f0in wif \u00f0e hw\u00e6ne to wrege, ne gelyf \u00feu to hra\u00f0e, for\u00feam \u00fee hie weor\u00f0a\u00f0 oft manegum to feonda,\nNe flit \u00f0u wi\u00f0 anwilne monn, ne wi\u00f0 oferspr\u00e6cne; manegum menn is forgifen \u00f0\u00e6t he spr\u00e6can m\u00e6g, &\nWite \u00f0\u00e6s maran \u00f0anc \u00f0e \u00f0u h\u00e6bbe \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6s \u00fee \u00f0e monne gehate ne hopa \u00feu to swi\u00f0e to \u00f0am \u00f0e \u00fee\nNe beo \u00f0u to anwille, for\u00f0am \u00fee is geliclicra \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u seo mid rihte oferst\u00e6led, \u00feonne \u00f0u oferst\u00e6le\nSprec ofter embe o\u00f0res monnes weld\u00e6de \u00feonne emb \u00f0ine agna, & cy\u00f0 \u00f0a manegum monnum.\n\u00d0onne \u00feu eald sie & manegra ealdra cwydas & lara geaxod h\u00e6bbe, gedo hi \u00f0onne \u00f0am giongan to\n\u00deeah \u00fee monn hwelces yfeles onhlige, & \u00feu \u00f0e unscyldigne wite, ne rex \u00f0u hw\u00e6t hi r\u00e6den o\u00f0\u00f0e\n\u00deonne \u00feu geselgost sio, \u00feenc \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu m\u00e6ge unsel\u00f0a ge\u00f0olian gif heo \u00f0e on becumen: for\u00f0am \u00fee\nNe hopa \u00f0u to o\u00feres monnes dea\u00f0e: uncu\u00f0 hwa lengest libbe.\n\u00d0eah \u00fee earm friond lytel sylle, nim hit to miccles \u00feances.\nGif \u00f0u earm weor\u00f0e, ge\u00feenc \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u hit ea\u00f0e ge\u00feolie: ge\u00feenc \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee \u00fein modor nacodne geb\u00e6r.\nNe ondr\u00e6d \u00feu \u00fee dea\u00f0 to swi\u00f0e; ne geleofa\u00f0 monn noht myrges \u00fea hwile \u00f0e he him dea\u00f0 ondr\u00e6t.\nNe forgit \u00feu hine \u00feeah ealne weg, \u00fey l\u00e6s \u00feu \u00feolige \u00fe\u00e6s ecan lifes.\nGif \u00f0e mon mid yfele leanige \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu to gode do, ne wit \u00feu hit no gode, ac warena \u00fee sylne.\n\u00d0y oftor mon gehylt \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6f\u00f0, gif he him ondr\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t hit o\u00fesceote; \u00f0y mon d\u00e6l\u00f0 sp\u00e6rlice \u00fee mon\nGif \u00f0u bearn h\u00e6bbe, l\u00e6r \u00fea cr\u00e6ftas, \u00fe\u00e6t hie m\u00e6gen be \u00feon libban; uncu\u00f0 hu him \u00e6t \u00e6htum ges\u00e6le.\nCr\u00e6ft bi\u00f0 b\u00e6tera \u00feonne \u00e6ht.\nNe gehat \u00feu nan \u00feinge twia: hw\u00e6t sceal hit \u00fee eft gehaten, buton hit w\u00e6re \u00e6r alogen.\nNe becyp \u00f0u \u00fein wiotod on wen: wite maran \u00feanc \u00f0\u00e6s \u00fee \u00f0u h\u00e6bbe, \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee \u00feu \u00fee wene.\nNe beo \u00f0u to yrsigende: of yrsunge wex\u00f0 hatunge, & of \u00f0\u00e6re ge\u00few\u00e6rnisse lufu.\n\u00d0\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feu niede yrsian scyle, gemetga \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feeah.\nForb\u00e6r oft \u00f0\u00e6t \u00feu ea\u00f0e wrecan m\u00e6ge: ge\u00f0yld bi\u00f0 middes eades.\nHelp \u00e6g\u00f0er ge cu\u00f0um ge uncu\u00feum \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feu m\u00e6ge; uncu\u00f0 hw\u00e6r hwa o\u00feres \u00f0urfe.\nNe wilna \u00feu ofer \u00feine m\u00e6\u00f0 to witanne embe \u00fea hiofenlican \u00feincg; for\u00feon \u00f0u eart eor\u00f0lic mon, axa \u00fee\nNe beo \u00f0u on \u00feinum yrre to anwille, for\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t yrre oft amyrre\u00f0 monnes mod \u00fe\u00e6t he ne m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t\nBeo gehealden on \u00f0\u00e6m \u00fee \u00f0u h\u00e6bbe: unpleolicre hit bi\u00f0 on lytlum scipe & lytlum w\u00e6tre, \u00feonne on\nNe wen \u00feu na \u00fe\u00e6t se yfla auht godes gestryne mid his yfle, for\u00f0am \u00feeah hit sume hwile forholen beo,\n\u00d0onne \u00feu geseo gingran mann \u00f0onne \u00f0u sie, & unwisran & unspedigran, \u00feonne ge\u00feenc \u00f0u hu oft se\nNe sec \u00f0u no \u00feurh lietas hu \u00fee gewur\u00f0an scyle, ac do swa \u00f0u betst m\u00e6ge; ea\u00f0e ger\u00e6de\u00fe god his\nForl\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu n\u00e6bbe to o\u00feres monnes gode andan, for\u00f0am \u00feu swencst \u00f0e sylfne swi\u00f0or \u00feonne hine.\nNe beo \u00feu ormod \u00feeah \u00f0e sie unriht gedemed; lyt monna wyr\u00f0 longe f\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e he o\u00f0erne\nGif \u00f0u wi\u00f0 hwone sace h\u00e6bbe, & git \u00feonne gesemede weor\u00f0en, ne wrec \u00feu no \u00f0a \u00e6rran yfelo, buton\nNe do \u00f0u nau\u00f0er: ne \u00f0e sylfne ne here, ne \u00f0e sylfne ne leah: \u00e6g\u00f0er \u00feara is dysigra manna \u00f0eaw, \u00fee\n\u00de\u00e6t is heah wisdom \u00fe\u00e6t wis mon liccette dysig, & \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00f0\u00e6t m\u00e6ste dysig, \u00fe\u00e6t dysig monn liccette\nSwa mon ma spric\u00f0, swa him l\u00e6s monna gelyf\u00f0.\nGif \u00feu hw\u00e6t on \u00fein druncen misdo, ne wit \u00feu hit no \u00f0am ealo\u00f0, for\u00f0on \u00f0u his weolde \u00fee sylf.\nNafa \u00f0u to yfel ellen, \u00feeah \u00f0e hwylc unwilla becume; oft brinc\u00f0 seo wyrd \u00feone willan, \u00f0e eft bi\u00f0\nNe wur\u00f0e \u00fee n\u00e6fre to \u00feys wa, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u \u00fee ne wene betran, for\u00feon \u00fee se wena \u00fee ne forl\u00e6t n\u00e6fre\nNe ceos n\u00e6nne monn be his \u00e6htum, ne \u00f0ina agna ne amyr; monig mon h\u00e6f\u00f0 micel feax on foran\nBisna \u00fee be sumum menn, for \u00feam \u00fee \u00e6lces monnes lif bi\u00f0 sumes monnes lar.\nNe forswiga \u00feu no \u00fe\u00e6t untala gedon sie, \u00feyl\u00e6s \u00fee menn wenan \u00f0\u00e6t hit \u00fee licige.\nGif \u00f0e mon mid ryhtre scylde brocige, ge\u00f0ola hit wel & beo his wel ge\u00f0afa.\nSprec \u00f0e gemetlice & eac swa geb\u00e6r, \u00f0y l\u00e6s \u00fee monn leasunga tio \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feu wene \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u \u00feina cysta\nNe hlyst \u00f0u no ungesceadwises monnes worda, for\u00feam h\u00e6f\u00f0 monig man \u00f0one un\u00f0eaw, \u00fe\u00e6t he ne con\nHit by\u00f0 dysig \u00fe\u00e6t man speca \u00e6r \u00feone he \u00fe\u00e6nce.\nNe rec \u00f0u weamodes wifes worda, for \u00feam \u00f0e heo \u00fee wile oft mid wope beswican.\nNe ondr\u00e6d \u00feu \u00f0e dea\u00f0 to swi\u00f0e for nanum wite; \u00f0eah he \u00f0e ful god ne \u00f0ynce, he bi\u00f0 \u00e6lces yfles ende,\nForseoh \u00f0isse worlde wlenca gif \u00f0u wille beon welig on \u00f0inum modo, for\u00f0am \u00fea \u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6s welan gitsia\u00f0\nGif \u00f0u \u00f0in agen amyrre, ne wit \u00f0u hit no gode ac warena \u00f0e sylfne.\nBruc \u00feinra \u00e6hta \u00fea hwile \u00fee \u00f0u hal sie; se unhala gitsere ah \u00fe\u00e6t feoh & nah hine sylfne.\nGe\u00feola \u00feines hlafordes yrre & \u00feines lareowes & his word swi\u00f0e wel, \u00feeah he \u00f0e cide.\nGif \u00f0e \u00f0ynce \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u to wr\u00e6ne sie, wit \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feinre ceolan, for\u00feam seo ceole is \u00f0\u00e6re wambe freond,\nDysig mon him ondr\u00e6t nietenu & wulfas, & ne ondr\u00e6t \u00feone mon \u00f0e hine tala l\u00e6r\u00f0.\nGif \u00feu strengo h\u00e6bbe, bruc \u00f0\u00e6re to nytte.\nGif \u00f0u wille godne hlisan habban, ne f\u00e6gna \u00f0u nanes yfeles.\nLiorna a hw\u00e6thugu; \u00f0eah \u00f0e \u00feine ges\u00e6l\u00f0a forl\u00e6tan, ne forl\u00e6tt \u00fee no \u00fein cr\u00e6ft.\nNe beo \u00feu to oferspr\u00e6ce, ac hlyst \u00e6lces monnes worda swi\u00f0e georne: for\u00f0am \u00fea word geopeniga\u00f0\nGif \u00f0u hwylcne cr\u00e6ft cunne, bega \u00feone georne: swa swa sorga & embhogan geycan monnes mod,\nLeorna a hw\u00e6thwugu \u00e6t \u00f0am wisran, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu m\u00e6ge l\u00e6ran \u00feone unwisran: \u00e6g\u00f0er \u00feara is swi\u00f0e nytt\nGif \u00f0u wylle hal beon, drinc \u00f0e ged\u00e6ftlice; \u00e6lc oferfyll & \u00e6lc idel fett unh\u00e6lo.\nNe l\u00e6t \u00feu no unlofod \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu swytele ongite \u00fe\u00e6t licwyr\u00f0e sie.\n\u00de\u00e6r \u00fee oht tweonige, lofa \u00fe\u00e6t gemetlice, \u00fey les \u00fee mon leasunga teo.\nNe truwa \u00feu no smyltum w\u00e6tre, ne bilwitne monn ne forsioh: oft stille w\u00e6ter sta\u00f0u brece\u00f0.\nOngin \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee to onhagige, for treowlicre is be st\u00e6\u00f0e to rowenne \u00feonne ut on s\u00e6 to seglianne.\nGif \u00f0e \u00e6t s\u00e6l\u00f0um to s\u00e6le, ahcsa \u00f0e hw\u00e6\u00f0er \u00e6negum \u00e6r swelc ges\u00e6lde; \u00f0onne meaht \u00f0u hit \u00f0y e\u00f0\nNe flit \u00f0u no wi\u00f0 ryhtwisne mon & wi\u00f0 unscyldigne, for\u00feam \u00fee god wric\u00f0 unrihte domas.\n\u00deeah \u00fee \u00fein eald gefera abelge, ne forgit \u00feu gif he \u00fee \u00e6fre \u00e6r gecwemde.\n\u00c6re mid \u00feinum oxum & offra mid \u00feinum recelse: dysige bio\u00f0 \u00fea men \u00fee wena\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hie cwemon\n\u00c6lce d\u00e6ge \u00f0u bist onnou\u00f0e, \u00e6lce d\u00e6ge \u00f0u scealt gode \u00feoncian \u00feines lifes.\n\u00deeah \u00f0e monig mon herige, ne gelyf \u00f0u him to wel, ac ge\u00feenc \u00fee sylf hw\u00e6t his so\u00f0es sie.\nL\u00e6t \u00f0e sceamian \u00f0\u00e6s hlisan, gif \u00f0e monn on lioge; f\u00e6gne \u00fe\u00e6s, gif \u00f0e mon so\u00f0 on secge & \u00feeah\nMencg a \u00fea blisse wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re unrotnesse; for\u00feam gif hiera o\u00f0er bi\u00f0 oht longe butan o\u00f0rum, \u00feonne bi\u00f0\nLiorna manega bec & gehyr monig spell; wite \u00f0eah hwylcum \u00feu gelyfan scyle: feola writa\u00f0 menn\nNe mer \u00f0u \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u h\u00e6bbe, \u00f0y l\u00e6s \u00fee ge\u00f0earfige to o\u00f0res monnes.\nNe rec \u00f0u to swi\u00f0e hu sio wyrd wandrige; se \u00f0e fullice \u00f0as world forsih\u00f0, ne ondr\u00e6t he him noht\n\u00d0onne hit \u00e6fre ge\u00f0w\u00e6rost sio, ondr\u00e6d \u00fee \u00f0onne unge\u00f0w\u00e6rnesse, & \u00feonne hit \u00f0e frecnost \u00feynce, wen\nBi\u00f0 a getriowre \u00feonne \u00fee mon to gelyfe, \u00fey les menn wenen \u00f0\u00e6t \u00feu nane trio\u00f0e n\u00e6bbe buton wi\u00f0\nSe \u00f0e him ealne weg ondr\u00e6t, se bi\u00f0 swylce he sie ealne weg cwellende.\nGif \u00f0u \u00f0e wille don moniges beteran, \u00feonne do \u00feu \u00f0e anes wyrsan.\nGif \u00f0u wylle \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0e monige ol\u00e6con, \u00feonne ol\u00e6ce \u00f0u anum swi\u00f0e georne.\nGif \u00f0u \u00feonne nylle nanum ol\u00e6can, forl\u00e6t \u00feonne eal \u00f0\u00e6t \u00feu age buton wiste & w\u00e6da & to swylcum\nGif \u00feu wilt \u00e6t manegum menn habban \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0e lica\u00f0, \u00feu scealt eac \u00e6t monegum menn ge\u00f0olian \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee\nGif \u00f0u wilt \u00e6t anum menn habban \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee lica\u00f0, \u00feu scealt him oft ge\u00f0afian \u00f0\u00e6t \u00fee ne lica\u00f0.\nNe meaht \u00f0u \u00e6t nanum menn habban his good, buton \u00feu m\u00e6ge hwilum his yfel ge\u00f0afian: for\u00f0am \u00fee\nStyr \u00feeah \u00e6lces yfles swa \u00feu swi\u00f0ost m\u00e6ge, swa \u00f0eah \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hit to wyrsan ne gebringe: ne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t\nGemet ne sec\u00f0 nan selre.\nGif \u00e6nig mon bi\u00f0 a \u00f0e unwior\u00f0ra \u00fee hine monig wis mon forsih\u00f0, \u00f0onne bi\u00f0 \u00e6lc dysig mon \u00fee\nOn \u00e6lcere ea swa wyrse fordes, swa betere fisces.\nHwe\u00f0er sceal cepinge \u00fee lofigen: \u00fee se \u00fee heo syllen sceall, \u00fee se \u00fee heo byggen wyle.\nWa \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feeode \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00e6l\u00f0eodigne cyng ungemetf\u00e6stne, feoh georne, & unmildheortne for on \u00fe\u00e6re\nSe \u00f0e anwaldes wilna\u00f0 ofer his hlaford, for twam \u00feingum he his wilna\u00f0: o\u00f0er twegra, o\u00fe\u00fee he wile\nNe acse \u00feu nanre wicce r\u00e6des, ne sech \u00feu riht \u00e6t deaden: so\u00f0lice god ascune\u00f0 swylce \u00feing.\nNe nym \u00feu medsceattes, for heo abl\u00e6nde\u00f0 wisra manna ge\u00f0ancas & w\u00e6nde\u00f0 rihtwisra word.\nAc sanctus Agustinus s\u00e6de swi\u00f0e swutul bispell by \u00f0y: gif ma manna wilnode on anre \u00f0eode anwaldes\n\u00deonne nella\u00f0 \u00fea heafdu eall anes weges.\nAc gif \u00f0e heafdu anes weges nella\u00f0, \u00feonne sceal \u00fe\u00e6t bodig bion \u00fey bysigre.\nTih\u00f0 \u00feara heafda \u00e6lc his wegas & li\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t bodig unnyt, bute \u00fe\u00e6t hit halt \u00fea heafdu \u00fe\u00e6t heora \u00e6lc ne\nGif hit \u00f0onne gewyr\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea heafdu to \u00f0am stronge gewior\u00f0a\u00fe, & hiora \u00e6lc swa swi\u00f0e tih\u00f0 fram\n& he s\u00e6de eac \u00fe\u00e6t sume wyrmas w\u00e6ren & sume fiscas \u00fee h\u00e6fden an heafod & monigne steort.\n\u00d0a steortas he s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t hulpan ealle \u00fe\u00e6s heafdes, & \u00fe\u00e6t heafod heora ealra.\nHio hebba\u00f0 up \u00fe\u00e6t heafod & him beforan scufa\u00f0.\n\u00de\u00e6t heafod & \u00fea eagan him wisia\u00f0 weg, & hie feda\u00f0 & feria\u00f0 & hie him folgia\u00f0.\nSwa bi\u00f0 eac feola wuhta on wiorlde \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00f0 fela fota.\nEalle \u00f0a fet hebba\u00f0 up \u00f0\u00e6t heafod, & \u00fe\u00e6t heafod hie fere\u00f0 & nere\u00f0.\nAc se hrefn, \u00f0e sume menn hata\u00f0 crabba, ne f\u00e6r\u00f0 naht gef\u00e6dlice mid twam heafdum, \u00f0eah he monigne",
